<title>ITALY: SOCCER SHOWCASE-SAMPDORIA BEAT MILAN 3-2 AT SAN SIRO.</title>
<headline>SOCCER SHOWCASE-SAMPDORIA BEAT MILAN 3-2 AT SAN SIRO.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-02-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sampdoria beat AC Milan 3-2</p>
<p>(halftime 1-1) in a Serie A match at the San Siro on Sunday:</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Milan - Weah 37, 57</p>
<p>Sampdoria - Mancini 1, Mihajlovic 74, Carparelli 79</p>
<p>Attendance: 50,000</p>
